# Project notes (Ciutatis)

## Public site Sentry (2026-07-11)

Landing app wired with `@sentry/nextjs` for org `thcargentina`, project
`ciutatis-public`. Project creation is blocked for members — an Owner must
create it, then set `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN` / `SENTRY_DSN` in
`apps/landing/.env.local`. See `.cursor/feature/sentry-public-landing.mdc`.

## Public site IA (2026-07-11)

Marketing pages consolidated to core routes with Product/Public nav dropdowns.
Legacy `/features`, `/how-it-works`, `/for-governments`, `/for-citizens` (and ES
equivalents) 301 into `/govops` or `/`. See `.cursor/feature/public-site-ia.mdc`.

Local landing proxies `/api/*` via `API_INTERNAL_BASE` (default
`https://admin.ciutatis.com`) so `/ar` and other public surfaces get real geo
JSON instead of the catch-all HTML page. Override to `http://localhost:3100`
when running the local API.

## Upstream merge branch (`merge/upstream-master-2026-07-11`)

- Merged `upstream/master` conservatively; `main` left untouched.
- Plugin extension breakage after merge came from hunk-union corruption in `@paperclipai/shared` (validators/types mashed with civic aliases).

## Plugin fork-compat extraction (2026-07-11)

Custom Ciutatis fixes that previously lived as inline stubs in shared are now:

1. **Host shims** — `packages/shared/src/fork-compat/upstream-stubs.ts` (+ `civic-exports.ts` layered on upstream `index.ts`)
2. **Installable plugin** — `packages/plugins/plugin-ciutatis-compat` (`@ciutatis/plugin-ciutatis-compat`, id `ciutatis.fork-compat`)
3. **SDK alias** — `PaperclipPlugin` → `CiutatisPlugin` in `packages/plugins/sdk/src/define-plugin.ts`

Plugin extension validators/types (`validators/plugin.ts`, `types/plugin.ts`, managed resource types) are restored from upstream so `@paperclipai/plugin-sdk` typechecks.
